flowchart TD
    Start(("Start of Turn")) --> load_context
    load_context["load_context<br/>(ContextAssembly gathers entities, facts, rules)"]
    load_context --> gm_verdict
    gm_verdict["gm_verdict<br/>(GMAgent decides intent and mechanical need)"]
    gm_verdict --> resolve
    resolve["resolve<br/>(Resolver executes mechanics and issues ProposedChanges)"]
    resolve --> narrate
    narrate["narrate<br/>(Narrator generates the GM prose)"]
    narrate --> persist_turn
    persist_turn["persist_turn<br/>(saves the turn in MongoDB)"]
    persist_turn --> Decision{"End of scene?"}
    Decision -->|Yes| canonize["canonize<br/>(CanonKeeper evaluates and writes to Neo4j)"]
    canonize --> End(("End"))
    Decision -->|No, Next turn| load_context
